// needs: threads net
// expect-exit: 0
// expect-stdout:
// p256 (PKCS #8) -> localhost|p256
// p384 (SEC1) -> localhost|p384
// rsa (PKCS #1) -> localhost|rsa
// server saw 3 connections
// bad key: Certificate bad EC private key
// no key block: Certificate no PRIVATE KEY, EC PRIVATE KEY or RSA PRIVATE KEY block

// Stdlib 3.2.5: server keys other than Ed25519: ECDSA P-256 (PKCS #8),
// P-384 (RFC 5915 `EC PRIVATE KEY`) and RSA (PKCS #1 `RSA PRIVATE KEY`,
// signing RSA-PSS), each certificate issued by the test CA, and the
// client checking the CertificateVerify against the leaf's key.
